      <div class="col-12 col-md-11">
	<div class="row">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">The experience</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-8 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">A Yomonsni massage is an indulgent, luxurious, immersive experience that penetrates every layer of your body, mind, and self. Properly done, the experience can take 4-5 hours, but is not focused on the clock at all.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">A Yomonsni massage appreciates and utilizes the psychology of relaxation, touch, acceptance, intimacy, trust, and bonding that happen during a massage. Utilizing this knowledge is what enables depth in mind and self massage and allows a Yomonsni massage to truly transcend your expectations.
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">Set in the rainforest of the Gold Coast Hinterland, the experience is truly an escape from the every day, a sensual retreat from your normal reality.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
	  </div>
	</div inner-row>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	


	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Mind</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-8 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Combining elements from life coaching, hypnosis, neuro-linguistic programming, meditation, every part of your mind is stilled, allowing you to truly let go from the every day world. Addressing your mind in this way enables a much deeper state of body relaxation and pleasure. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	
	
	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Body</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-8 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Combining elements from Swedish, Thai, Relaxation, Shiatsu, Aromatherapy and Reflexology, every part of your body is addressed, caressed, stroked, pleased and relaxed. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">This is not a massage where you simply lie on a table and have your body stroked, but one where whether on a table or a floor mat, your body is actively moved and stretched as part of the massage. This movement, common in Thai and Shiatsu styles, serves multiple purposes, enabling access to deeper muscles, under the shoulder blades for example. Movement also enables a way to manage the tension in muscles as they are being massaged. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	
	
	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Self</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-8 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Combining elements from nature therapy, art therapy, psychology, you are fully accepted, supported and encouraged to express and develop your self.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">Currently available art media that you can participate in while here: </p>
	    <ul>
	      <li>drawing (charcoal, graphite, pastels)</li>
	      <li>photography</li>
	      <li>modelling for either of the above</li>
      	      <li>alcohol ink</li>
	    </ul>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">Weather and personal comfort permitting, massages can be conducted in the open air rather than indoors.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	
       
